>
> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：射线延伸(ray_extend), 递减填充(shrinking_fill), 重涂色(recolor), 擦除(erase), 循环填充(cyclic_filling), 平移(translate), 对齐(align), 连线(connect), 印章覆盖(stamp_overlay), 计数(counting), 排序(sorting), 裁剪(crop), 镜像(mirror), 旋转(rotate), 填充(fill), 滑动(slide), 堆叠(stacking), 扩展(expand), 边框绘制(frame_drawing), 线段绘制(line_drawing), 对称补全(symmetry_completion)
